@startuml seq-diagram
actor Student
participant "Frontend (React App)" as Frontend
participant "Firebase Auth" as Auth
participant "Firestore DB" as DB

Student -> Frontend: Open Event Page
Frontend -> Auth: Verify Student Login
Auth --> Frontend: Authenticated

Student -> Frontend: Click "Claim Ticket"
Frontend -> DB: Create new Ticket (eventId, studentId, timestamp)
DB --> Frontend: Ticket Created (ticketId)

Frontend -> Student: Display QR Code / Confirmation
@enduml
